sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as User and own wallet
  participant T as Website (taker engine)
  participant Z as Zcash shielded pool
  participant M as Maker (our backend)
  participant E as Escrow (NEAR)
  participant I as intents.near
  participant O as 1Click and solvers

  Note over U,O: Price
  U->>T: amount, token, chain
  T->>O: how much for the USDC? (quote)
  T-->>U: one price, with a guaranteed minimum
  U->>T: pay ZEC into the website's temporary wallet (QR)

  Note over T,M: Quote, over encrypted Zcash memos
  T->>Z: request memo (amount, key-half point A, NEAR key)
  Z-->>M: 
  M->>Z: quote memo (USDC amount, key-half point B, deadlines)
  Z-->>T: 
  T->>Z: acceptance memo + premium
  Z-->>M: 

  Note over T,E: Lock both sides
  M->>E: open: USDC in, A, B, NEAR key, deadlines, plus a NEAR stipend to that key
  T->>E: read: open is final and matches the quote
  T->>Z: fund the shared address (key a + b)
  M->>Z: see the ZEC, wait for confirmations
  M->>E: set_ready

  Note over T,E: Claim, sent by the taker
  T->>E: commit_claim (publishes only a hash)
  T->>E: claim(a) after the lock is final
  M->>E: read a
  M->>Z: take the ZEC with a + b

  Note over T,O: Payout and exit
  T->>E: withdraw
  E->>I: USDC, owned by the taker's NEAR key
  T->>O: fresh quote, then one signed message
  O->>I: execute
  O-->>U: tokens arrive on the selected chain
